      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَاعَمْتُهُ</span></b>  <i>I ate with him.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And
[hence] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَاعَمَا</span>, said of two pigeons, (tropical:)  <i>They billed;
